Feb-27 16:58:25.476 [Actor Thread 34] INFO  nextflow.processor.TaskProcessor - [SANGERTOL_GENOMEASSEMBLY:GENOMEASSEMBLY:NUCLEAR_ASSEMBLY:HIFIASM_ASSEMBLY:HIFIASM (2)] cache hash: c69e4b5715d62f4e60b59d888364c025; mode: STANDARD; entries: [
